Description: Professional GUI application for provisioning and maintaining Ubuntu Digital Signage Kiosks
 Digital Signage Toolkit is a comprehensive management application for Ubuntu-based
 digital signage kiosks. It provides:
 .
  * Master Setup - Complete system provisioning for new kiosks
  * Audit & Fix - Maintenance operations for existing kiosks
  * OS Upgrade - Safe, non-interactive OS upgrades with automatic snapshots
  * Watchdog Management - Visual control for self-healing systems
  * System Restore - Full system state restoration using Timeshift
  * Hardware Monitoring - Real-time system health metrics
 .
 This application replaces manual Bash scripts with a modern, robust GUI interface
 built with PyQt6, providing non-blocking operations and real-time feedback.

